    "description": "Help Center hub: card subtitle for the URL safety guide"
  },
  "helpGuideUrlSafetyIntro": "Before you open any scanned web link, our comprehensive 6-layer forensic safety engine evaluates the URL against modern phishing heuristics, homograph spoofing attacks, and malicious redirect traps.",
