    "description": "Help Center hub: card subtitle for the QuishingGuard guide"
  },
  "helpGuideQuishingIntro": "Quishing (QR Phishing) occurs when criminals paste physical fraudulent sticker QR codes over legitimate QR codes on parking meters, restaurant menus, payment counters, or transit signs.",
  "@helpGuideQuishingIntro": {
    "description": "QuishingGuard help screen: intro paragraph (explains what quishing is)"
